  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixD10lxFQymVx_ozWgYfeYftCitSPMONdYKdglEpE6hrw6NHfjjZOhrdrVf_YmDWmhQT7T7jJaMwi69epUPJRq-1jJ9I_dP5ItkRNwSwPPsqbKF4CjoAzfrVt3TVUWTtOoYSgW8GygSlUwYxS5yvXpXSrzRL0dyLxxbEgW5DU7LhTEqEdojkRpl49Vrlc/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Apr%2017,%202025,%2009_17_57%20PM.png\"><img alt=\"לוח שנה עם פנים זועפות - שכל הימים מסומנים בו עם &quot;אירועים מיוחדים&quot;\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixD10lxFQymVx_ozWgYfeYftCitSPMONdYKdglEpE6hrw6NHfjjZOhrdrVf_YmDWmhQT7T7jJaMwi69epUPJRq-1jJ9I_dP5ItkRNwSwPPsqbKF4CjoAzfrVt3TVUWTtOoYSgW8GygSlUwYxS5yvXpXSrzRL0dyLxxbEgW5DU7LhTEqEdojkRpl49Vrlc/w320-h320/ChatGPT%20Image%20Apr%2017,%202025,%2009_17_57%20PM.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ימים שכאלה</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><blockquote>עַד מְלֹאת יְמֵי טָהֳרָהּ</blockquote></span></div><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּעַם - כָּךְ אוֹמְרִים,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵי שָׁם בֶּעָבָר.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִרְאוּ כָּל הַיָּמִים,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַמָּשׁ אוֹתוֹ דָּבָר.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיָּמִים הָיוּ כְּתִקּוּנָם,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שָׁעוֹת נָעוּ בַּעֲצַלְתַּיִם.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַיְלָה וְיוֹמָם,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַזְּמַן עָבַר בֵּינְתַיִם.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַבְּרִיּוֹת שָׁקְטוּ - שָׁתְקוּ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא הִרְבּוּ אֹמֶר.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֻּלָּם זָכְרוּ - יָדְעוּ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כַּמָּה הַיּוֹם לְעֹמֶר.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל בִּרְבוֹת הַיָּמִים,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנָשִׁים אִבְּדוּ סַבְלָנוּת.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נָקְטוּ בְּכָל הָאֶמְצָעִים,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְהַעֲנִיק לַחַיִּים מַשְׁמָעוּת.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה הִתְחִיל בִּימֵי עִיּוּן,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהִמְשִׁיךְ בְּגִבּוּשׁ וּמְכִירוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַיּוֹם, יְמֵי אִמּוּן,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּבָר מִזְּמַן אֵינָם מוֹתָרוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיּוֹם נַעֲשֶׂה קָלֶנְדָּרִי,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יָמִים - הָפְכוּ מַחֲלָה.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה כְּבָר לֹא פּוֹפּוּלָרִי,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִצְבֹּר יְמֵי חֻפְשָׁה.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּחֲמִישִׁי וְרִאשׁוֹן,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא מְקַבְּלִים קָהָל.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַמַּעֲנֶה בַּטֵּלֵפוֹן,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סָגוּר בְּדֶרֶךְ כְּלָל.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">'יוֹם אִשָּׁה' כָּל שָׁבוּעַ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוֹפְרִים יְמֵי בִּיּוּץ.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֵשׁ גַּם יוֹם קָבוּעַ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְפִנּוּי גֶּזֶם חוּץ.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חוֹגְגִים יְמֵי הֻלֶּדֶת,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גּוֹרְעִים יְמֵי אַבְטָלָה.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"יָמִים עַל יְמֵי מֶלֶךְ\",</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רוֹקְדִים עַל כָּל חֲתֻנָּה.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל יוֹם הוּא 'גּוֹרָלִי',</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יְמֵי חַג - בְּתַשְׁלוּם.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמַּס הַדִּיפֵרֶנְצְיָאלִי,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּתְּלוּשׁ&nbsp;עַצְמוֹ - גָּלוּם.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"יוֹם יוֹם אֲנִי תּוֹלֵשׁ\",</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">דַּף מִתּוֹךְ הַלּוּחַ.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי כְּבָר לֹא חוֹשֵׁשׁ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִשְׁכֹּחַ יוֹם דָּלוּחַ.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם \"יֵשׁ יָמִים לְלֹא מַרְגּוֹעַ\",</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי עוֹשֶׂה מֵהֶם יוֹם כֵּיף.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְיָמִים שֶׁאֵין לִי מִקְצוֹעַ,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי בַּיָּם, מִשְׁתַּזֵּף.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִזְּמַן כְּבָר שָׁכַחְתִּי,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶת \"יְמֵי פּוֹמְפֵּיי הָאַחֲרוֹנִים\".</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַף פַּעַם לֹא קָרָאתִי,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶת \"יְמֵי צִקְלָג\" הָרִאשׁוֹנִים.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם חָלִילָה בָּא לְכָאן</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹם עָצוּב כָּזֶה.</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָשִׁיר עִם מַיְלֵךְ קַאהַן,</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"יוֹמָם יְצַוֶּה\".</span></span></p><p><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">(<a href=\"https://youtu.be/QlgL0sJelvI\">וכאן 👈 הקישור לשיר היפה הזה</a>)</span></span></p>"
}
